    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d164">

                <pb facs="0297" n="255" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg255"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Adams.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 563.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-04-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 22, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have received your despatch (No. 367) of
                    the 8th instant, and its enclosure. Your proceedings in the case of the steamer
                    Japan are approved; and the prompt steps taken at the foreign office in the
                    matter are highly satisfactory. Your despatch will be submitted to the Secretary
                    of the Navy.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams</hi>, Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
